collector -> execution: "Repair9: S forwarding/ancestry repair and fresh decode preserve the same logical payload across GC, not raw addresses"
control -> qualification: "Repair9: proven callable exposure and extra S restoration cost gate closure/capture removal; generic fallback remains counted"
control -> execution: "Repair9: GVM semantic S/checkpoint plan precedes physical FrameSpec and host placement; no C-only closure deletion"
execution -> roots: "Repair9: operand snapshot/check/reload and typed no-GC corridor preserve complete canonical sources"
roots -> collector: "Repair9: actual roster barriers publish S to source-based GC; labels and emitter checks do not synchronize workers"
control -> execution: "Repair9: choose complete generic/static semantic lowering before S publication; no unsupported late helper replay"
execution -> roots: "Repair9: root destination before same-registration authority transfer and ACK; UNKNOWN retains both graphs"
roots -> collector: "Repair9: conversion and rebuilt multi-shot graphs preserve canonical roots, fresh repair and graph identity"
control -> retirement: "Repair9: query settles one conversion/registration; entry alpha is not eliminated-closure or exit credit"
control -> roots: "Repair9: same-wait conversion publishes complete rooted destination before execution/receipt/ACK"
